# ── Fixture & corpus MILIK repo (bukan file eksternal) — wajib di-track ──
# Test RTL CPU emu + seed corpus fuzz + filelist bench. Tanpa ini fresh
# checkout / CI kehilangan sumber → test gagal (path-relative ke repo).
!examples/rtl/*.sv
!examples/rtl/*.v
!examples/synth/*.sv
!crates/mivon-fuzz/fuzz/corpus/seeds/*.sv
!crates/mivon-fuzz/fuzz/corpus/mv/*.mv
